# Formatting and lint on staged files only — under a second in practice.
#
# Deliberately not the test suite. A pre-commit hook that runs everything
# gets bypassed with --no-verify the first time someone is in a hurry, and a
# hook people routinely skip is worse than no hook. Correctness is CI's job;
# this one only keeps mechanical noise out of the diff.
pnpm exec lint-staged
